==Overview==
The '''Scientist Mech''' is an [[Exclusive]] [[Units|unit]] which was released in [[Episode 73 Part 1 Update]]. It is based on the '''[[Laser Scientist Toilet|Quad Laser Scientist Skibidi Toilet Mech]]''' but without one laser. It was controlled by TV Woman in [[Secret Agent|Episode 73 (Part 1)]] of Skibidi Toilet.

== Appearance ==
The toilet looks like the regular [[Scientist Toilet]] but with a shorter beard, and being more mechanical in some ways. It has four lasers, but one of the lasers is broken.

==Obtainment==
This unit can be obtained by buying it in the [[Astro Upgraded Titan Cameraman|Shop]] for {{Robux|299}} (Original price: {{Robux|399}}) . You can also purchase this unit in the [[Marketplace]], get it from [[Trading]], or receiving it from the [[Post Office]].
