==Strategy==
*While it does take a hefty amount to place, this unit deals a great amount of DPS for it's cost but [[Saber Mutant Toilet|someone]] surpassed this method. Use it when trying to beat waves easily.
*Place it as early as you can to deal insane amounts of damage. This unit cannot be stunned.
==Trivia==
*This is the first toilet unit in the game even though he is controlled by [[TV Woman]] in the series.
*Units that use toilets as transport, like [[Car Speakerman]] or [[Glitch Cameraman]], do not count.
*The second toilet unit belongs to (tied) [[Arachnid Militant Toilet]] and [[Military Mutant Toilet Girl]], which are both toilets.

*This unit does not have the same model as the [[Laser Scientist Toilet]], as it would confuse other players.

* This unit can easily carry / beat [[Nightmare Mode|Nightmare mode]]. This unit got buffed a lot, from 40k to 53.3333k to 56k and now 60k DPS
*
*

* This unit somehow does more DPS than [[Astro Upgraded Titan Cameraman]]
* This unit cannot be buffed with booster units, such as [[Chief Clockman]]
* This unit got a new face as his Man face is missing
* His model looks like the same as [[Rabid Rabbit Toilet]], just with different colors, no armor, and different head.
